ENTRY            30410   20090310   20090724   20090720       3135
SUBENT        30410001   20090310   20090724   20090720       3135
BIB                 12         23
INSTITUTE  (3CHFNTU)
REFERENCE  (J,CHP,1,(1),1,196304)
AUTHOR     (Y.C.Hsu,C.Y.Huang,P.K.Tseng,Y.K.Tai)
TITLE      Neutron total cross section of arsenic at 14 MeV.
FACILITY   (CCW,3CHFNTU)
           Deuteron energy of 140 keV.
INC-SOURCE (D-T) T(d,n)He-4 reaction, Zr-T target.
METHOD     Transmission measurement in a good-geometry.
DETECTOR   (SCIN) Plastic scintillator of 1inch * 1inch diam. with
           a Dumont 6292 photomultiplier.
           .Another plastic scintillator of the same size placed
           at 50 cm distance from the neutron source, and
            Zn-S(Ag) scintillator at 1 m from the n-source were
           used as the neutron-yield monitor.
MONITOR    Absolute, transmission measurement
HISTORY    (19770812C) KO.-Reentry after 70051 but from orig.ref.-
           (19831122U) DG.-Conversion from Iso-quant to Reaction
                        form.-
           (20090309A) SD:Updated to new date formats,lower case.
CORRECTION The effect of scattered neutrons was found to be less
           than 0.3% of the rate obtained from the direct
           neutron beam.
ERR-ANALYS No further information.
ENDBIB              23
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           26
ENDENTRY             1
